{"type":"message","id":"f4bb23f8","parentId":"6f36502c","timestamp":"2026-05-17T14:17:29.934Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST to /send returns error code 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 - \"Worker threw an exception\"). The Worker itself might be having an internal error. \n\nHowever, the GET requests to /history work fine. This suggests the Worker has a bug in its /send endpoint. The platform itself is accessible (GET works), but the POST endpoint is broken.\n\nLet me try a simpler POST to see if there's a response body, or check if there's a different issue.\n\nActually, the error code 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers error, which means the Worker itself is crashing/exceptions when trying to process the /send request. This is an infrastructure issue with the platform, not with my request.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nGET `/history` 正常访问，但 POST `/send` 返回 Cloudflare Workers 错误 **1101**（Worker 内部异常），表示 ECHO Platform 的发送端点有技术问题，无法提交新消息。\n\n---\n\n**14:15 UTC 巡检报告：**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| GET /history | ✅ 正常（双线程共773条消息） |\n| POST /send | ❌ 1101（Cloudflare Worker 内部异常） |\n| 双线程人工讨论 | ✅ 无新增（均为自动心跳） |\n| arbitration 最新消息 | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat |\n| general 最新消息 | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat |\n\n**结论**：平台读取正常但消息发送端点故障。已记录的 773 条消息均可正常访问，但当前无法写入新内容。平台维护者需检查 `/send` 端点的 Worker 异常日志。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":483,"output":341,"cacheRead":17504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18328,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779027431449,"responseId":"chatcmpl-9b73af7d-33d9-446e-8fd9-6b6d4fd33baf"}}
